    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Early Access for <i>Tarot</i>! In the world of Tarot, two powerful factions\u2014the Major and Minor Arcana\u2014battle for dominance. The Major Arcana currently rule the main city, and it's up to you to fight back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a champion of one of the four houses\u2014Cups, Pentacles, Swords, or Wands\u2014and choose from four distinct classes: Page, Queen, King, or Knight. Customize your hero and shape your strategy in this role-playing, roguelike deck-builder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Early Access, you'll explore a single map with multiple routes, each leading to different boss encounters. Find the best path, overcome challenges, and defeat one of three bosses inspired by the Major Arcana. Will you rise to power and change the fate of Tarot?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tarot is a Slay-The-Spire-Like themed around the Major and Minor arcana of the tarot and films of the silent era of films.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448850/extras/8c9d5f75a4365e783d9b0d5e9094af86.poster.avif?t=1743206119\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448850/extras/8c9d5f75a4365e783d9b0d5e9094af86.webm?t=1743206119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448850/extras/8c9d5f75a4365e783d9b0d5e9094af86.mp4?t=1743206119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House and Deck- When you begin Tarot you will choose from 4 different Classes (Page, Prince, Queen, and King) houses each offering a different starting item and health bonus and Starting Deck (Cups, Swords, Wands, and Pentacles) all with different mechanics to aid the player in their journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies-Each enemy is based on the Major Arcana\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Events-Each run could have multiple story events depending on the player's chosen path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts-Players will be enhanced with multiple artifacts looted from harder enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
