ds, and Pentacles) all with different mechanics to aid the player in their journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies-Each enemy is based on the Major Arcana\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Events-Each run could have multiple story events depending on the player's chosen path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts-Players will be enhanced with multiple artifacts looted from harder enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
